algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: ComputeProbeComplexity
Input: Finite category C = (Ob, Hom, compose, id)
Output: (pc, minimal_separating_family)

for k = 0, 1, ..., |Ob|:
    for each subset S ⊆ Ob with |S| = k:
        if TestSeparation(C, S):
            return (k, S)
return (|Ob|, Ob)

Subroutine: TestSeparation(C, S)
for each (X, Y) in Ob × Ob:
    for each pair f ≠ g in Hom(X, Y):
        separated = False
        for P in S:
            for h in Hom(P, X):
                if h ∘ f ≠ h ∘ g:
                    separated = True; break
            if separated: break
        if not separated: return False
return True
